00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:24.860
Pass through boundaries of life and death, stride over the peak of the sky

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:32.060
Look at this dim dark sky from the distance

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:42.190
Glowing tears on fair skin

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:47.930
Melt this dark night

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:52.730
Souls entwine both on watch

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:58.460
Protect the candle-like warmth

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:03.700
Under the night sky sunflowers are swaying in the wind

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:06.390
As the night will always pass by

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:11.260
Let's embrace the new dawn

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:14.990
Fleeting Meteor

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:18.300
Broke the silence of the sky

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:22.730
Call for new heroes with my remaining brightness

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:25.260
Burn out the flame of life in the wind

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:27.590
Penetrate the endless horizon

00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:29.930
Cross over the long night to another end

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:32.990
Search for that destination

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:35.660
Fly towards the other side of my dream

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.360
Episode 15

00:01:52.730 --> 00:01:55.130
You've completely pissed me off

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:57.600
Now I’ll show you

00:01:58.060 --> 00:02:01.860
the Fiend Art made through absorbing people’s blood

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:03.800
My most powerful attack

00:02:04.460 --> 00:02:06.930
Blood Absorption

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:08.860
Oh, no

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:10.960
My spirit energy

00:02:18.460 --> 00:02:20.660
Master, you're quickly losing spirit energy

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.530
I can’t remain much longer

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:24.260
Ling Er’s energy comes from me

00:02:24.530 --> 00:02:26.060
If my spirit energy is absorbed by that old monster

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:27.460
Ling Er will be influenced as well

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:29.600
Ling Er, return to the Hun Tian Beads

00:02:29.930 --> 00:02:30.600
I’ll handle it

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:31.260
Master

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:38.060
I won’t let you hurt Muzi

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:40.330
Relying on that dagger?

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:52.530
This is the real Controlling Art

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:54.060
My blood is burning

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:57.200
he real dragon blood on the knife can corrode blood

00:02:58.130 --> 00:03:00.000
You hurt my arm

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:05.000
After absorbing blood, my Fiend Art becomes Fiend Blood

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:08.130
It is now at its strongest

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:12.730
I'm losing spirit energy

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:14.200
My strength

00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:18.000
The cultivation level I just reached will…

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:20.860
You, bitch, hurt my arm

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:23.460
I’ll kill you first

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:26.330
Muzi

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:27.460
Yingxiong

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:31.600
Muzi

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:35.600
Go die

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:40.800
No

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:53.000
Don’t worry, after I absorb your spirit energy

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:55.600
I’ll kill you softly

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:06.060
Little snake, little snake

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:10.330
Damn it, I wasn't able to take revenge

00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:10.930
Muzi

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:12.000
Muzi

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:17.000
Wait for me

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:35.330
Take this spirit energy

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:43.330
Wha…what is this?

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:50.000
This is the Soul of dragon blood

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:53.000
meaning that is dragon's blood, of course

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:00.060
It stopped?

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:03.060
No, how could this be?

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:09.060
Monster, go to hell!

00:06:34.110 --> 00:06:37.370
Revenge

00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:41.170
My fellow Senior apprentice will surely take revenge

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:45.440
I’ll leave this voice curse on you

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:50.110
You’ll live in immeasurable fear

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:55.570
My parents and neighbors

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:57.510
Little snake

00:06:58.170 --> 00:06:59.770
I finally avenged you

00:07:00.510 --> 00:07:01.410
Could you see it?

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:08.970
Elder

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:11.970
Have you seen enough?

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:19.840
Your purpose is to get the Hun Tian Beads, right?

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:27.110
Incredible, you noticed me

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:31.510
When Muzi entered my psychonauts and contacted the Hun Tian Beads

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:32.910
I felt that

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:34.240
Dimly

00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:35.570
some other power was watching

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:38.440
I’m not sure of your actual purpose

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:39.710
I even worry that

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:41.770
debunking your existence this early

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:43.710
will bring destruction upon us

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:48.910
If so, why are you doing so now?

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:51.040
Because

00:07:51.770 --> 00:07:53.910
You might be able to save Muzi

00:07:56.570 --> 00:07:57.710
If Muzi dies

00:07:59.170 --> 00:08:00.110
whether it’s brings good or bad

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:02.310
What's left would be meaningless

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:07.170
I never expected you to be so foolishly sentimental

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:11.040
As long as cultivators still have a little life left

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:12.310
There’s always a way of saving them

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:13.510
But

00:08:13.770 --> 00:08:15.440
What reason do I have to help you?

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:17.370
If you have any demands

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:19.110
I’ll satisfy them

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:21.440
Just please save Muzi

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:23.770
I have been keeping an eye on you

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:27.840
in order to get your Hun Tian Beads

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:39.110
Please take it

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:46.110
If I could take them now, then I wouldn't need you

00:08:47.570 --> 00:08:48.910
Then how can you receive them?

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:52.170
The place I’m in

00:08:52.310 --> 00:08:53.640
Is different from your space

00:08:54.640 --> 00:08:56.640
I’ll make a three years’ covenant

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:58.970
Bring me The Hun Tian Beads in three years

00:08:59.570 --> 00:09:02.540
Could I know the name of the space you're in?

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:08.440
Saying the name is restricted by the highest rule of this place

00:09:09.370 --> 00:09:11.910
You'll need to find those answers for yourself

00:09:13.310 --> 00:09:15.240
What if I can’t fulfill the agreement in time?

00:09:19.110 --> 00:09:21.910
I can save her when she is close to death

00:09:22.110 --> 00:09:25.140
I can also kill her easily

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:32.370
I understand

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:36.040
No matter how far it is

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:37.710
I, Ma Yingxiong

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:40.110
Will reach the place you live in time

00:09:40.770 --> 00:09:43.570
Enough, I’m going to save this girl

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:45.240
You just stay out of the way

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:52.640
My new plane is ruined

00:09:53.710 --> 00:09:55.370
Butler, I want to say something

00:09:56.310 --> 00:09:57.240
It’s ok, young master

00:09:57.640 --> 00:09:59.240
The plane is gone, just buy a new one

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:00.370
Wait

00:10:01.170 --> 00:10:02.310
How much was this plane?

00:10:03.640 --> 00:10:04.710
Maybe four or five hundred million yuan

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:06.040
It’s…

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:08.510
It’s so cheap

00:10:08.910 --> 00:10:10.370
Buy more planes next time

00:10:12.570 --> 00:10:13.770
Yes, young master

00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:19.370
How are we getting home now?

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:27.240
Butler, you are the best

00:10:27.910 --> 00:10:28.910
Faster

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:30.840
Yes, young master

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:38.840
I want to experience the feeling of running in the wind

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:42.440
D cup

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:09.040
Haven't we arrived yet?

00:11:10.510 --> 00:11:11.110
No need to rush

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:13.110
I’m not rushing

00:11:13.640 --> 00:11:14.840
I just don’t know

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:17.110
where master Muzi wants to take me to

00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:18.710
It’s so hot out here

00:11:21.510 --> 00:11:23.570
If you're afraid, just go back

00:11:26.770 --> 00:11:29.440
If I’m going to face something terrible

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:31.440
Then I shouldn’t leave you alone

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:38.750
You can take it off now

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:55.150
This is the last

00:11:57.220 --> 00:11:58.020
The last?

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:04.950
When I was young, my mom and I usually came here for picnics

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:08.350
She taught me a lot here

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:12.420
Including

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:14.490
How to find a good husband

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:17.750
Are you satisfied?

00:12:24.820 --> 00:12:26.090
If you're not satisfied

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:32.550
I have thousand ways to satisfy you

00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:36.090
When you say it like that, how could I be not satisfied…

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:38.420
You seem to be being dishonest~

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:41.150
Maybe I still need to do something

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:43.090
Just let me go

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:44.690
Miss Muzi

00:12:46.150 --> 00:12:46.950
“wild fight”

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:48.690
You don’t want it?

00:12:53.950 --> 00:12:55.490
Wild…wild fight?

00:12:59.550 --> 00:12:59.950
I

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:04.020
Wan…want to try

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:08.350
Come

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:11.220
You mean this kind of fight?

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:14.150
What did you think I meant?

00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:16.620
Of..of course it's…

00:13:24.550 --> 00:13:27.020
If you can say it, then I can give it

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:32.420
I won’t let you experience anything terrible

00:13:33.090 --> 00:13:33.690
I promise

00:13:38.220 --> 00:13:39.020
So just rest easy

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:40.550
You don’t need to worry anymore

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:41.890
You won’t

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:43.890
be alone anymore

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:46.950
there's no need to force yourself to do something you don’t like

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:49.820
whether it is fight or anything else

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:51.820
you don’t need to suffer alone

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:54.690
but I still have something to do

00:13:56.290 --> 00:13:57.550
Revenge? Or...

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:01.220
I have to take back

00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:01.950
my real first kiss

